            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-summary-check",
        "moduleId": "truth-tables-and-equivalence",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "summary",
        "title": "四个 connective 的真值条件与自检",
        "markdown": "| connective | 记号 | 为真条件 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| conjunction | $P \\land Q$ | 都真 |\n| disjunction | $P \\lor Q$ | 至少一个真 |\n| conditional | $P \\Rightarrow Q$ | $P$ 假或 $Q$ 真 |\n| biconditional | $P \\Leftrightarrow Q$ | 同真或同假 |\n\n自检：按括号算出复合式真值，并说明 $P$ 假时条件句为何为真。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-logic-as-grammar",
            "tb-and-or",
            "tb-conditional",
            "tb-biconditional",
            "tb-truth-tables",
